# Targets chezmoi REMOVES from $HOME on every apply — migration cleanup for
# artifacts this repo used to deploy or generate but no longer does. Patterns
# are TARGET paths (same matching rules as .chezmoiignore). Removing a path
# that doesn't exist is a no-op, so entries here are safe fleet-wide and
# self-heal stale hosts without a bespoke cleanup script.
#
# Warp retirement (2026-07): chezmoi-deployed Warp configs; user-created Warp data is not touched.
AppData/Local/warp/Warp/config/settings.toml
AppData/Local/warp/Warp/config/keybindings.yaml
AppData/Roaming/warp/Warp/data/themes/catppuccin-mocha.yaml
